= Deployment prerequisites =

This repository is organized as MediaWiki source. Before importing it into a live wiki, verify the target site's namespaces and extensions.

== Required / assumed capabilities ==
* MediaWiki page/revision system
* Semantic MediaWiki for semantic properties and `#ask` queries
* CategoryTree where `<categorytree>` is used

== Portal namespace ==
`Portal:` is not a default MediaWiki namespace on every installation. V2 includes `Portal/` because the historical BITwiki design explicitly uses portals as high-level knowledge entry points.

Before import, either register a Portal namespace in the target wiki or deliberately map portal source into another namespace while preserving public titles through redirects. Do not silently change portal titles during deployment.

== Source fidelity ==
The V1 corpus inventory contains unreconciled pages. Do not bulk-delete live V1 pages solely because a V2 file does not yet exist for them.

Safe migration:
<pre>
import / create reviewed V2 pages
→ verify rendering and semantic data
→ compare each V1 source family
→ move/merge/redirect only after reconciliation
→ preserve revision history where possible
</pre>

